+		/*
+		 * A legacy (non-MLD) STA associated to an MLD AP operates on a
+		 * single AP link.  Reaching here means mac80211 left the key
+		 * link unspecified, but pushing the pairwise key across all MLD
+		 * links races with sibling-band sta_link teardown (wcid.sta
